Held aloft by dark magic, the floating necropolis known as Naxxramas is both an indomitable fortress and a potent war machine. Within its halls are some of the Scourge’s most elite military forces and most vile experiments. The infamous archlich Kel’Thuzad holds dominion over Naxxramas, and he intends to use the powerful crystal at its apex to annihilate the Undercity in the Lich King’s name.

Garek, Anya, and Leonid sneak aboard the necropolis on a daring mission of sabotage. Time runs short, and without hope for reinforcements, the trio have only each other to rely upon as they fight to save the Forsaken…
}

